{#-
  Tells somebody their Quill account has been opened again. Sent once,
  when it is reopened, to everybody whose address was verified: they were
  told when it was closed, and otherwise may never try to log in again.
  It is also a check on a reopening nobody expected.

  It does not promise that everything came back: training records a
  sponsor's period ran out on while the account was closed are gone.

  It says where their newsletter stands, because a "no" given while the
  account was closed comes back with them. Context:
    name                 who to greet: their full name, or their
                         username where the account has none
    username             the account's username
    email                the address this is sent to, said back to them
    login_url            the log in page
    forgot_password_url  the page that sends a link to set a password
    wants_news           whether they are set to receive news and updates
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}

{% block subject %}Your Quill account has been opened again{% endblock subject %}
{% block preheader %}You can log in to it again.{% endblock preheader %}

{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Your account is *open* again") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}Your Quill account, with the username <strong>{{ username }}</strong>, has been opened again. You can log in to it as before.{% endcall %}
{{ c.paragraph("Everything is as you left it: the places you belong to, what you can do in Quill, and the training records that are still kept.") }}
{{ c.button("Log in to Quill", login_url) }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}If you have forgotten your password, or never set one, you can <a href="{{ forgot_password_url }}">set a new one</a>.{% endcall %}
{% if wants_news %}
{{ c.paragraph("You are set to receive news and updates from Quill Medical. You can change that at any time in Settings.") }}
{% else %}
{{ c.paragraph("You are not set to receive news and updates from Quill Medical. You can change that at any time in Settings.") }}
{% endif %}
{{ c.small("This email was sent to " ~ email ~ ".") }}
{{ c.small("If you did not expect this, speak to whoever looks after Quill where you work or train.") }}
{% endblock body %}

{% block reason %}You are receiving this because your Quill account was opened again.{% endblock reason %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

Your Quill account, with the username {{ username }}, has been opened again. You can log in to it as before.

Everything is as you left it: the places you belong to, what you can do in Quill, and the training records that are still kept.

Log in to Quill: {{ login_url }}

If you have forgotten your password, or never set one, you can set a new one: {{ forgot_password_url }}

{% if wants_news %}You are set to receive news and updates from Quill Medical.{% else %}You are not set to receive news and updates from Quill Medical.{% endif %} You can change that at any time in Settings.

This email was sent to {{ email }}.

If you did not expect this, speak to whoever looks after Quill where you work or train.
{% endblock text %}
